    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why This Adventure Feels Special</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <strong>pencil-drawn</strong> visuals bring a nostalgic, delicate art style that feels like walking through a dreamscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    A <strong>sole developer</strong> passion project\u2014every scene, puzzle, and detail radiates authenticity and care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.poster.avif?t=1753692430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.webm?t=1753692430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.mp4?t=1753692430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classic Puzzles, Memorable Interactions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Navigate intuitive point\u2011and\u2011click gameplay with inventory-based logic and dialogue-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Solve imaginative tasks\u2014like returning a favor to a neighbor using a petroleum-soaked doormat\u2014in a neighborhood riddled with quirky characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Players love the blend of lighthearted humor and subtle emotional depth, even as tasks reveal stories of everyday hardship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Designed for a cozy evening: playtime is typically around 3 hours, perfect for a cold winter night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Includes 11 Steam achievements, captions, and full language support in English, Ukrainian, German and russian.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why This Adventure Feels Special</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <strong>pencil-drawn</strong> visuals bring a nostalgic, delicate art style that feels like walking through a dreamscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    A <strong>sole developer</strong> passion project\u2014every scene, puzzle, and detail radiates authenticity and care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.poster.avif?t=1753692430\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.webm?t=1753692430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.mp4?t=1753692430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classic Puzzles, Memorable Interactions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Navigate intuitive point\u2011and\u2011click gameplay with inventory-based logic and dialogue-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Solve imaginative tasks\u2014like returning a favor to a neighbor using a petroleum-soaked doormat\u2014in a neighborhood riddled with quirky characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Players love the blend of lighthearted humor and subtle emotional depth, even as tasks reveal stories of everyday hardship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Designed for a cozy evening: playtime is typically around 3 hours, perfect for a cold winter night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Includes 11 Steam achievements, captions, and full language support in English, Ukrainian, German and russian.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "This point-and-click game immerses you in a hand\u2011drawn world on a cold winter night in 1990s Ukraine. As Alexey, a young man locked out of his apartment, you embark on an unexpectedly heartfelt journey to reclaim your stolen TV. Along the way, uncover charming secrets in an atmospheric neighborhood.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Ukrainian, German",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe game has a charm and the effort and authenticity surrounding the characters, locations, and events really add to a memorable experience. The premise is so simple but from it grows a compelling narrative. I would like to see more adventures starring Alexey.\u201d<br>Brokenowly<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s full of intriguing, if somewhat confusing puzzles, that really get those brain cogs ticking over, and graphically, I\u2019d go as far as saying it\u2019s a masterpiece.\u201d<br>Fullsync<br><br>\u201cAlexey's Winter: Night Adventure is a very nice adventure, the player will quickly become fond of Alexey. Following him throughout his journey in the snowy streets of the former Soviet Union is a real pleasure.\u201d<br>DMT | Graphic Adventure<br>",
